{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19085","headline":"送李中丞赴楚州 · 刘禹锡","name":"送李中丞赴楚州","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"缇骑朱旗入楚城，士林皆贺振家声。\n儿童但喜迎宾守，故吏犹应记姓名。\n万顷水田连郭秀，四时烟月映淮清。\n忆君初得崑山玉，同向扬州携手行。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19085.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19085","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}